#: src/app/[locale]/[...slug]/music.tsx:95
msgid ""
"Many pieces of music, which – as his contemporaries claimed – he\n"
"              performed in concerts with mastery, remained in the form of\n"
"              manuscripts. Besides the popular transcriptions of music for\n"
"              various instruments by famous composers of that time, (like\n"
"              Beethoven or Verdi) they comprise the most valuable part of the\n"
"              music legacy of Jan Ruckgaber."
msgstr ""
"Muchas piezas musicales, que – según afirmaban sus contemporáneos – él\n"
"              interpretó en conciertos con maestría, permanecieron en forma de\n"
"              manuscritos. Además de las populares transcripciones de música para\n"
"              diversos instrumentos de famosos compositores de esa época, (como\n"
"              Beethoven o Verdi) constituyen la parte más valiosa del\n"
"              legado musical de Jan Ruckgaber."

