#: src/app/[locale]/[...slug]/about.tsx:28
msgid ""
"My name is Ruckgaber, Andrzej Ruckgaber. I was born in Poland and I\n"
"            certainly feel Polish, but the foreign name has always made me think\n"
"            about the origin of my family. Curiosity and the family tale of my\n"
"            great-great-grandfather, Jan Ruckgaber, a pianist, and composer in\n"
"            Lviv, presently forgotten, did incline me to take up his biography.\n"
"            He was not only a musician, but also a teacher and a passionate\n"
"            promoter of music."
msgstr "Mi nombre es Ruckgaber, Andrzej Ruckgaber. Nací en Polonia y ciertamente me siento polaco, pero el nombre extranjero siempre me ha hecho pensar en el origen de mi familia. La curiosidad y la historia familiar de mi tatarabuelo, Jan Ruckgaber, un pianista y compositor en Lviv, actualmente olvidado, me inclinaron a tomar su biografía. No solo era músico, sino también maestro y un apasionado promotor de la música."

#: src/app/[locale]/[...slug]/lvivArchives.tsx:63
msgid ""
"Neither the Ruckgaber Archive, nor the documents from the music\n"
"              library of the Galician Music Society, have yet been sufficiently\n"
"              cataloged or worked out."
msgstr ""
"Ni el Archivo Ruckgaber ni los documentos de la biblioteca musical\n"
"              de la Sociedad Musical Gallega han sido suficientemente catalogados\n"
"              o procesados."

#: src/components/organisms/CompositionMarkup.tsx:2025
msgid "notes only"
msgstr "solo notas"

#: src/app/[locale]/[...slug]/life.tsx:61
msgid "On the 15th of August 1834, at the age of nearly 35, Jan Ruckgaber married Maria Xavier Markl, the daughter of a Hungarian baron John Markl and a Polish woman Jane née Balewicz."
msgstr "El 15 de agosto de 1834, a la edad de casi 35 años, Jan Ruckgaber se casó con Maria Xavier Markl, la hija de un barón húngaro John Markl y una mujer polaca Jane née Balewicz."

